{"title":"2014 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, the angles of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> are shown in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the diagram, we can see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/2/e62cf3631efb736776f2227ae1a472046902995a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ABC = (x + 10)^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/d/29dfbd1e8cd701b6bf2d44b5abb4bca79166d31f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle BAC = (x - 10)^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9ea01ce1590f50fd29f3d39071d6ca33598eba0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ACB = x^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" />. The sum of the interior angles in a triangle is always <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/841a40c5623b265cf47dab7d91a43758e62cf77a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 10)^{\\circ} + (x - 10)^{\\circ} + x^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"269\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/1935864c0b33fe3be3b47b3de4427ce6e5860198.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3x)^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5f41215b1c453422c08b6897b3d205a8f5add0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{180}{3} = \\boxed{60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017234303\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 491/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1933/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.714      1 -total\n 47.26%    6.954      1 2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n 40.38%    5.941      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36021:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017234303 and revision id 287160. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}